# Copy to .env.local and fill in to use Supabase locally. Never commit .env.local.
# Both values are in Supabase: Project Settings -> API.
# The anon key is public by design (it is shipped to the browser); security comes from the
# row-level rules in supabase/schema.sql. Never put the service_role key here.
VITE_SUPABASE_URL=
VITE_SUPABASE_ANON_KEY=
